<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Interpool started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Interpool started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette started coverage of Interpool Inc as buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/8 to 21-3/4.</p>
</text>
